{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05670","headline":"和上巳连寒食有怀京洛 · 孙逖","name":"和上巳连寒食有怀京洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天津御柳碧遥遥，轩骑相从半下朝。\n行乐光辉寒食借，太平歌舞晚春饶。\n红妆楼下东郊道，青草洲边南渡桥。\n坐见司空扫西第，看君侍从落花朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}